<aside class="cta-container" aria-label="Analyze your disclosure packet with DisclosurePro AI">
	<div class="cta-content">
		<div class="cta-eyebrow">⚡ 1st Property Report Free • 10-Second AI Scan</div>
		<h2>Have a Seller Disclosure or Inspection PDF? Scan It Before Contingencies Expire.</h2>
		<p>
			Upload 100+ page seller disclosures, home inspection PDFs, WDO termite reports, and HOA packets. DisclosurePro AI flags buried red flags, jumps to exact PDF page numbers, and calculates your repair credit request automatically.
		</p>
		<ul class="cta-proof-list" aria-label="Included in free scan">
			<li>✓ Exact PDF Page Citations</li>
			<li>✓ Local Repair Credit Math</li>
			<li>✓ Ready-to-Sign Credit Addendum</li>
		</ul>
		<div class="cta-actions">
			<a
				href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=ai.disclosurepro.app"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="cta-button"
				data-gtag-event="play_store_click"
				data-gtag-label="blog_bottom_cta_google_play"
			>
				Download Free on Google Play 🚀
			</a>
			<a
				href="/download"
				class="cta-secondary-button"
